{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Import

Applications can be imported using their ID:

```shell
terraform import dokploy_application.example ghi789-application-id
```

Or using import blocks (Terraform 1.5+):

```hcl
import {
  to = dokploy_application.example
  id = "ghi789-application-id"
}
```

### Finding Application IDs

Use the `dokploy_environments` data source to discover application IDs within environments:

```hcl
data "dokploy_environments" "all" {
  project_id = dokploy_project.example.id
}

output "application_ids" {
  value = flatten([
    for env in data.dokploy_environments.all.environments : [
      for app in env.applications : {
        environment = env.name
        name        = app.name
        id          = app.id
      }
    ]
  ])
}
```
